group><article-title>Expression of IFN-gamma-inducible protein; monocyte chemotactic proteins 1, 3, and 4; and eotaxin in TH1- and TH2-mediated lung diseases</article-title><source>J Allergy Clin Immunol</source><year>2001</year><volume>107</volume><fpage>664</fpage><lpage>670</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11295656</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1067/mai.2001.113524</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Andersen</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Doherty</surname><given-names>TM</given-names></name><name><surname>Pai</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Weldingh</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The prognosis of latent tuberculosis: can disease be predicted?</article-title><source>Trends in Molecular Medicine</source><year>2007</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>175</fpage><lpage>182</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17418641</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.molmed.2007.03.004</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>